  roomDescription:
  - 'The room remains dimly illuminated in the center, with candles lit around the
    tombstones. A makeshift, dug-out graveyard in the middle of the room had thrown
    mounds of dirt and concrete across the ground. '
  - 'In the center, 5 hooded people rest on their knees, muttering prayers to these
    tombstones. To the right, a small crowd of similar-looking men patiently waits.
    They range from a young adult to an elderly man. Doors are positioned straight
    ahead and on the left wall. '
