      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[9].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].itemsToAdd.Array.data[0]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aaaa5be6da9d1214b836fb1cc2c94976, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[7].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[7].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: Your gut feels good. It wants to join in on the fun. You look to the
        crowd of robed men praying in the center of the room. You can't help but
        follow the call of joy in your stomach. In a flash, you dig up the dead bodies
        and feed yourself on the dead flesh. Both the robed men praying and the men
        waiting on the right wall look furious. You have disgraced their fallen.
        They both retaliate.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[7].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].netHealthImpact.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[8].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[8].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You check the prayer site at the center of the room and feel compelled
        to also empathize with the fallen by bringing your arms in prayer. You recite
        a prayer that flows out of your mouth on instinct rather than conscious awareness:
        "May those who have passed never be forgotten and shall be learned from."
        Both the robed men and the men on the right wall shine a sign of approval
        with their nods and acknowledgement. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[8].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].netHealthImpact.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[9].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 375383051353289788, guid: edf5d16c2336cef4b88a8e3d0f19817d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[9].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Fearful of the prayer site at the center of the room, you used your
        hands to attempt to rip out one of the tombstones. Your body screamed to
        rid the room of this deadly presence, even if it was illogical. To your horror,
        you successfully unearthed one of the tombstones. Both the robed men praying
        and the other group of men on the right scowl at you. They retaliate because
        you had enacted violence on their sacred sanctuary. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
